@startuml startupShutdown
hide empty description

[*] --> Off

Off --> Init : power on
Init : initialize HAL, drivers, services, applications
Init : config service loads the parameters from storage
Init --> Running : ApplicationController_start()
Init --> Error : initialization failed

Running : process requests
Running --> Shutdown : ApplicationController_stop()
Running --> Error : unrecoverable error

Error : report error, outputs in safe state
Error --> Shutdown : ApplicationController_stop()

Shutdown : store data, stop applications, services, drivers
Shutdown --> Off : done

Off --> [*]

note right of Running
  ApplicationController_getState()
  returns the current state
end note
@enduml
